| 250K | 3.78 (asym var) | 3.31–4.24 (p95 4.47) | 7.60 (asym var) | 7.51–7.76 (p95 7.83) | **2.01x** | 9.29 | 3.257917e-8 | WIN | 46.64ms |
| 1M | 9.37 | 8.45–11.55 (p95 14.29) | 26.60 | 23.68–27.28 (p95 29.61) | **2.84x** | 6.10 | 3.286367e-7 | WIN | 93.17ms |

